# One Small Improvement in Your Code

This part:

```ruby id="0jyksm"
if word != "stop"
  word = gets.chomp
```

is unnecessary because you already got input above.

You could simplify it to:

```ruby id="6b7y33"
while true
  p "Enter A Word: "
  word = gets.chomp

  if word == "stop"
    p "You have entered the correct word!"
    break
  end
end
```

Cleaner code is another important skill you’ll develop over time.

